    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i checked the solenoids and they seem to be pulling the right current, but the pressure still jumps around totally randomly. sometimes it's fine for a few minutes then it just starts acting crazy. it almost feels like there's something intermittent throwing it off. any idea why it would be so inconsistent?",
